SUMMARY:Juilliard at The Apollo: Filles de Kilimanjaro
LOCATION:The Apollo's Victoria Theater 1\, Harlem (South)
DESCRIPTION:With a career defined by constant reinvention\, Miles Davis con
 
tinuously shaped and reshaped the sound of jazz\, moving from bebop to cool
 
 jazz\, post-bop to fusion\, and beyond. His time in New York City\, a hub 
 
of jazz innovation and culture\, started with Juilliard. To mark the iconic
 
 alum's 100th birthday\, Juilliard Jazz and the Apollo Theater present a se
 
ries of multidisciplinary performances on the legendary Harlem stage\, hono
 
ring some of Davis' landmark albums: Birth of the Cool\, Bitches Brew\, and
 
 Kind of Blue. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/juilliard-at-th
 
e-apollo-filles-de-new-york-new-york-11-18-2026/event/0000651CD3ABA657
